54,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f22698d1f072135d5770e0a6f2a34e3b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Johana,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks! I never heard back from them!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364340324813_1237\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msncry.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364340324813_1718\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msncry.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sent several emails and nothing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1738770,"PostDate":1364340393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Johana,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks! I never heard back from them!!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364340324813_1237\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msncry.gif\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1364340324813_1718\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msncry.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sent several emails and nothing!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gygarrido@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.4.112.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359255942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265139.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Form