> User Mrsloiseau (285543)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d33c9c6a49220db8882a34e3b1fbde81","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Amanda, how much would you say you have spent in total for your wedding package that you created? What wedding package did you book?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have the Ultimate wedding package booked for October 4th 2012.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609877,"PostDate":1334973282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amanda, how much would you say you have spent in total for your wedding package that you created? What wedding package did you book?<\/p> <p> I have the Ultimate wedding package booked for October 4th 2012.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"briekarpiuk@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332465860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253072.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BrieK","Id":253072,"Name":"BrieK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ade9bfe7b46b4ae074613ac65c45b13","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Monica Cabrera[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m getting married at Dreams on Sept. 27, 2012.  So let me get this straight the $95 day pass is NOT in addition to the cocktail\/dinner price, I only have to pay the difference?  So if dinner is $62 I have I have to pay an additional (95-62=33)  $33 and not $95?  if that is true that would great!  Since it is also our honeymoon, none of our guest are not staying at Dreams.   \n    Can anyone recommend a photography?  We are having a small wedding.. 5 guest for sure and 10 at the most so we dont need a photographer all day but I do want some photos at ceremony and on the beach.  \n    I booked an appointment with Suzanne Morel for my hair and makeup.  Since I&#039;m the only getting services done I need to go to her salon.  Does anyone know how far it is from the resort?  I&#039;ll have a car but i want to make sure its not too far. \n     Can anyone recommend a florist?  I&#039;ve about Lola at Florenta.  Anyone else that has reasonable prices?  Thanks! \n[\/quote] \n \n \n Sorry for the delay but yes that is correct, you only pay the 95 total, which includes the 62 for the wedding.  I am using emweddings.com for photography.  Suzanne Morale is down in Cabo San Lucas, so 15-20 minutes.  I work with Alina and the new florist place.  Dreams only allows you to use one of the two vendors, the second was recently added and has reasonable prices...they also respond quickly.","Attachments":[],"Id":1614179,"PostDate":1335844078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Monica Cabrera<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm getting married at Dreams on Sept. 27, 2012.\u00a0 So let me get this straight the $95 day pass is NOT in addition to the cocktail\/dinner price, I only have to pay the difference?\u00a0 So if dinner is $62 I have I have to pay an additional (95-62=33)\u00a0 $33 and not $95?\u00a0 if that is true that would great!\u00a0 Since it is also our honeymoon, none of our guest are not staying at Dreams.\u00a0 <\/p> <p> \u00a0\u00a0 Can anyone recommend a photography?\u00a0 We are having a small wedding.. 5 guest for sure and 10 at the most so we dont need a photographer all day but\u00a0I do want some photos at ceremony and on the beach.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0\u00a0 I booked an appointment with Suzanne Morel for my hair and makeup.\u00a0 Since I'm the only getting services done I need to go to her salon.\u00a0 Does anyone know how far it is from the resort?\u00a0 I'll have a car but i want to make sure its not too far.<\/p> <p> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Can anyone recommend a florist?\u00a0 I've about Lola at Florenta.\u00a0 Anyone else that has reasonable prices?\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> Sorry for the delay but yes that is correct, you only pay the 95 total, which includes the 62 for the wedding.\u00a0 I am using emweddings.com for photography.\u00a0 Suzanne Morale is down in Cabo San Lucas, so 15-20 minutes.\u00a0 I work with Alina and the new florist place.\u00a0 Dreams only allows you to use one of the two vendors, the second was recently added and has reasonable prices...they also respond quickly.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de4ed6756bb37b3391cbcc2db8150ed7","RawContent":"&lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_585\"&gt; Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_578\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;I am currently finalizing my menu for November wedding at Dreams. On the call, it was asked and confirmed that we could offer 2 to 3 main meal choices from the Gold menu, as long as we put it on the name cards and told the resort in advance. Apparently now my planner Jessica is saying they only allow 2 choices. II said that on&amp;nbsp;the webinar we were told&amp;nbsp;we could have three but&amp;nbsp;she said it is policy. I also&amp;nbsp;know other brides getting married around the same time at Los Cabos are allowed to have their guests choose from 3. Could you provide any advice or does anyone have it in print from the resort that they can pick from 3 mains? That would be helpful.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_580\"&gt; thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1665186,"PostDate":1348171900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_585\"> Hi ladies,<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_578\"> \u00a0I am currently finalizing my menu for November wedding at Dreams. On the call, it was asked and confirmed that we could offer 2 to 3 main meal choices from the Gold menu, as long as we put it on the name cards and told the resort in advance. Apparently now my planner Jessica is saying they only allow 2 choices. II said that on\u00a0the webinar we were told\u00a0we could have three but\u00a0she said it is policy. I also\u00a0know other brides getting married around the same time at Los Cabos are allowed to have their guests choose from 3. Could you provide any advice or does anyone have it in print from the resort that they can pick from 3 mains? That would be helpful.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348169037761_580\"> thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbecker@bclc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319736074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247145.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McLecker","Id":247145,"Name":"McLecker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fa36e07c712d3e574f238ca3ef373d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have a quick questions regarding outside vendors at Dreams.&amp;nbsp; I have chosen Enrique Morales for photography, Arturo Sotomayor, Spanish guitar for the ceremony and cocktail hour, Emporio for flowers and DJ Ricardo for the reception.&amp;nbsp; Is Dreams going to charge the $95 day pass for these outside vendors to come to the wedding?&amp;nbsp; Thanks everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1665722,"PostDate":1348331018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have a quick questions regarding outside vendors at Dreams.\u00a0 I have chosen Enrique Morales for photography, Arturo Sotomayor, Spanish guitar for the ceremony and cocktail hour, Emporio for flowers and DJ Ricardo for the reception.\u00a0 Is Dreams going to charge the $95 day pass for these outside vendors to come to the wedding?\u00a0 Thanks everyone!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauren.scott36@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327259821,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250331.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"laurenscott","Id":250331,"Name":"laurenscott","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f7531f57fb34fa4e479a7eb7888f7dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; If they are preferred vendors (emporia and dj ricado are apparently) then you should not have to pay the fee! I confirmed we won&#039;t be paying the $95 for DJ Ricardo so you shouldn&#039;t either. Let me know what you find out.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1666050,"PostDate":1348458074,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> If they are preferred vendors (emporia and dj ricado are apparently) then you should not have to pay the fee! I confirmed we won't be paying the $95 for DJ Ricardo so you shouldn't either. Let me know what you find out.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbecker@bclc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319736074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247145.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McLecker","Id":247145,"Name":"McLecker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fab82a248db8e591c4aa014471c1528f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I did not have to pay the day pass for my Vendors. I did however do a vendor table with Vendor meals from Dreams and they have a different plate of food for them, I think it was like $26 or $32, right around there.&amp;nbsp; This is optional, but since they are there so long, esp the photogs. I think it is the right thing to do.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1666179,"PostDate":1348502638,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I did not have to pay the day pass for my Vendors. I did however do a vendor table with Vendor meals from Dreams and they have a different plate of food for them, I think it was like $26 or $32, right around there.\u00a0 This is optional, but since they are there so long, esp the photogs. I think it is the right thing to do.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erika.holler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.177.241.195","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1224480180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212330.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erika J","Id":212330,"Name":"Erika J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4efb4ba40b14fbb02e6375cbeb0c7361","RawContent":"I did not have to pay for any vendor passes. I did share with Magda everyone that was coming off resort (guests &amp; vendors) before I arrived so there was no confusion. I will say, make sure your vendors, especially photographer and makeup &amp; hair what room you&#039;ll be in for the wedding day. They sent my hair and make up artist to the wrong room. Luckily she had the email I sent her and came to the correct room.","Attachments":[],"Id":1666746,"PostDate":1348597368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did not have to pay for any vendor passes. I did share with Magda everyone that was coming off resort (guests & vendors) before I arrived so there was no confusion. I will say, make sure your vendors, especially photographer and makeup & hair what room you'll be in for the wedding day. They sent my hair and make up artist to the wrong room. Luckily she had the email I sent her and came to the correct room.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BukkyLanskiWedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1324708381,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248883.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"wedding92012","Id":248883,"Name":"wedding92012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90150e06dca037804e602f394809458b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have another question for you Dreams Brides - what did you do about kids meals? I have a 2 year old, 4 year old, 5 year old, and an 11 year old. We are doing the gold plated meal but I keep getting conflicting info about what the options are for kids. Anyone able to tell me how they fed children and the price of their meals?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1669201,"PostDate":1349150307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have another question for you Dreams Brides - what did you do about kids meals? I have a 2 year old, 4 year old, 5 year old, and an 11 year old. We are doing the gold plated meal but I keep getting conflicting info about what the options are for kids. Anyone able to tell me how they fed children and the price of their meals?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbecker@bclc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319736074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247145.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McLecker","Id":247145,"Name":"McLecker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7651728baac3e4851501dc35b2c7016","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We did kids meals, I think it was chicken strips and fries. I dont remember the exact cost at the moment. I think it was like around $15?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1669207,"PostDate":1349152253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We did kids meals, I think it was chicken strips and fries. I dont remember the exact cost at the moment. I think it was like around $15?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erika.holler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.177.241.195","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1224480180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212330.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erika J","Id":212330,"Name":"Erika J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2faa81bff9dac5f14afa09020d883c70","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We fed my daughter (3 1\/2) &amp;amp; my niece (6) pasta with red sauce at the Rehearsal Dinner at Portofino and chicken strips and fries at the wedding reception. Heard the girls loved both meals.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is some of the options Magda provided me: &lt;span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;\"&gt;hamburgers, hot dogs, chicken nuggets, pasta in with or red sauce&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Costs: &lt;span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;\"&gt;Rehearsal dinner child cost: $10&lt;\/span&gt;\t   &lt;span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;\"&gt;Wedding child cost: $32.50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1669210,"PostDate":1349152793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We fed my daughter (3 1\/2) & my niece (6) pasta with red sauce at the Rehearsal Dinner at Portofino and chicken strips and fries at the wedding reception. Heard the girls loved both meals.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is some of the options Magda provided me: <span lang=\"EN-US\"  style=\"font-family:&quot\">hamburgers, hot dogs, chicken nuggets, pasta in with or red sauce<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Costs: <span lang=\"EN-US\"  style=\"font-family:&quot\">Rehearsal dinner child cost: $10<\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span lang=\"EN-US\"  style=\"font-family:&quot\">Wedding child cost: $32.50<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"BukkyLanskiWedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1324708381,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248883.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"wedding92012","Id":248883,"Name":"wedding92012","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
