{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.228.200.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef5fc04fc14477c39a014088a292a5a7","RawContent":"I have heard that getting blood drawn is a requirement, I don&#039;t believe I&#039;ve read any reviews about it.  we are having a church wedding here In ny prior to going to Mexico, so we&#039;re just having a symbolic ceremony in Mexico, which does not require blood work or anything really.\n\nwe thought about doing the legal ceremony in Mexico but there were too many rules about being there a few days before &amp;amp; having a witness there for a few days, etc.  so that&#039;s why we decided just to do the symbolic ceremony.","Attachments":[],"Id":1833120,"PostDate":1392132276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have heard that getting blood drawn is a requirement, I don't believe I've read any reviews about it.  we are having a church wedding here In ny prior to going to Mexico, so we're just having a symbolic ceremony in Mexico, which does not require blood work or anything really.<br>\nwe thought about doing the legal ceremony in Mexico but there were too many rules about being there a few days before & having a witness there for a few days, etc.  so that's why we decided just to do the symbolic ceremony.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janelle.gonzales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.201.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373911579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271556.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jnellerose","Id":271556,"Name":"jnellerose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b46d0b3602944046dd92e8f4836edbf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For a legal ceremony it is a requirement to get your blood drawn. &amp;nbsp;If you have a symbolic ceremony, you can skip that step.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833474,"PostDate":1392262650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For a legal ceremony it is a requirement to get your blood drawn. \u00a0If you have a symbolic ceremony, you can skip that step.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.60.227.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b879d7da07e6179e5db82364fe0966b0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Long story but I started to work with Mariana than in November was told that Madga was my new WC.&amp;nbsp; Had a very difficult time getting any replies back.&amp;nbsp; Destination Weddings Coordinator really assisted with this issue.&amp;nbsp; Madga started replying and I have the majority of details planned and confirmed.&amp;nbsp; I just received an email today from Madga that she is no longer there as of this Saturday, Saturday February 22nd.&amp;nbsp; The email is the same but the new WC is now, Shantal Carrizales.&amp;nbsp; Here is to hoping that it is lucky number 3!&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834641,"PostDate":1392842487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Long story but I started to work with Mariana than in November was told that Madga was my new WC.\u00a0 Had a very difficult time getting any replies back.\u00a0 Destination Weddings Coordinator really assisted with this issue.\u00a0 Madga started replying and I have the majority of details planned and confirmed.\u00a0 I just received an email today from Madga that she is no longer there as of this Saturday, Saturday February 22nd.\u00a0 The email is the same but the new WC is now, Shantal Carrizales.\u00a0 Here is to hoping that it is lucky number 3!\u00a0 <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"K.schaum@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.151.232.234","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326597631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249908.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KSchaum","Id":249908,"Name":"KSchaum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.228.200.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7634915586b229ffec3ecd657c8f53d8","RawContent":"wow... I wonder what is going on over there with them changing wedding coordinators so frequently lately.  hmmm... shantal carrizales, that name sounds familiar.  I think she was the wedding coordinator at melia Cabo real when we did our site visit in Cabo.  if it&#039;s any consolation to you, she was pretty quick In replying back to us and was very nice.  she seemed really young though but seemed to have experience.  good luck! I hope it turns out well for you.  when&#039;s the wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":1834644,"PostDate":1392843149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                wow... I wonder what is going on over there with them changing wedding coordinators so frequently lately.  hmmm... shantal carrizales, that name sounds familiar.  I think she was the wedding coordinator at melia Cabo real when we did our site visit in Cabo.  if it's any consolation to you, she was pretty quick In replying back to us and was very nice.  she seemed really young though but seemed to have experience.  good luck! I hope it turns out well for you.  when's the wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janelle.gonzales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.201.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373911579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271556.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jnellerose","Id":271556,"Name":"jnellerose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.1.191.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47bd36b4ff7ce93161761150336007da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cmahrer\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you get legally married prior to going to Cabos, you don&#039;t need to get blood test!&amp;nbsp; I just did it last week!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m getting married in August 2014 and really haven&#039;t planned a thing yet, except the ceremony and reception location!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834681,"PostDate":1392860745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275017\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275017-cmahrer\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cmahrer<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you get legally married prior to going to Cabos, you don't need to get blood test!\u00a0 I just did it last week!\u00a0 I'm getting married in August 2014 and really haven't planned a thing yet, except the ceremony and reception location!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"scatoula3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.1.191.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373934056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271569.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scatoula3","Id":271569,"Name":"scatoula3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.151.232.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2cc12dc8f2b6ad0bb08f41274a5e3ab8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@jnellerose&amp;nbsp; Our wedding date is May 18th,2014.&amp;nbsp; Less than 3 months.... I feel pretty confident that things will work out, hopefully our new wedding coordinator will be there long enough.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1834941,"PostDate":1392987845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@jnellerose\u00a0 Our wedding date is May 18th,2014.\u00a0 Less than 3 months.... I feel pretty confident that things will work out, hopefully our new wedding coordinator will be there long enough.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"K.schaum@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.151.232.234","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326597631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249908.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KSchaum","Id":249908,"Name":"KSchaum","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.83.42.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f529913dde8e3e14cfa42c0d7baeaf5","RawContent":"Hi! I&#039;m getting married at Dreams on My 31st, 2014. I had a similar situation with the change of WC. My FI and I flew down last May and met with Yesica Garcia and loved her. We booked our date immediately, and Yesica never failed to get back to us in less than a week, she gave me a list of vendors and a lot of them were already booked or never responded. I did do a lot research and booked my own vendors which were all vetted through Yesica.\n\n\nIn December 2013 I was emailing Yesica and didn&#039;t hear back for over  a month. I figured it&#039;s the holidays and she was busy (as was I). We&#039;ll after almost 8 weeks, I emailed again and was told she was no longer with Dreams. I went into an immediate panic. I was assigned Marcela, but I felt like she was new and probably had a lot of catching up to do trying to pick up where Yesica left off. Dreams has weddings in a daily basis and I just didn&#039;t feel comfortable anymore.\n\n\nWe ended up hiring Gaby Cobian from Vivid Occasions as our \"Day-of WC\" and she has been great. I am so much more at ease. It definitely was not budgeted for but to have someone create a timeline, confirm all vendors and assures everything will be under control that day makes a world of a difference.  \n\n\nGood luck!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1838828,"PostDate":1395159518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! I'm getting married at Dreams on My 31st, 2014. I had a similar situation with the change of WC. My FI and I flew down last May and met with Yesica Garcia and loved her. We booked our date immediately, and Yesica never failed to get back to us in less than a week, she gave me a list of vendors and a lot of them were already booked or never responded. I did do a lot research and booked my own vendors which were all vetted through Yesica.<br><br>\nIn December 2013 I was emailing Yesica and didn't hear back for over  a month. I figured it's the holidays and she was busy (as was I). We'll after almost 8 weeks, I emailed again and was told she was no longer with Dreams. I went into an immediate panic. I was assigned Marcela, but I felt like she was new and probably had a lot of catching up to do trying to pick up where Yesica left off. Dreams has weddings in a daily basis and I just didn't feel comfortable anymore.<br><br>\nWe ended up hiring Gaby Cobian from Vivid Occasions as our \"Day-of WC\" and she has been great. I am so much more at ease. It definitely was not budgeted for but to have someone create a timeline, confirm all vendors and assures everything will be under control that day makes a world of a difference.  <br><br>\nGood luck!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marisol.salguero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"161.149.63.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362945137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267159.jpg?_r=1404881843","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SCchickie","Id":267159,"Name":"SCchickie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.149.147.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec46d26cd1da633bb922cf71a9c21016","RawContent":"Hi everyone! \n\n\nThis is my first time posting on here, but I see I am in the same boat as others! My wedding is May 6, 2014 and my new WC is Shantal Carrizales!  I still have some bigger details to plan, but communication hasn&#039;t been very successful. Is anyone else still in the same boat?\n\n\nWedding is a little over a month away, so I am starting to panic :(\n\n\nThanks:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1841321,"PostDate":1396209634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! <br><br>\nThis is my first time posting on here, but I see I am in the same boat as others! My wedding is May 6, 2014 and my new WC is Shantal Carrizales!  I still have some bigger details to plan, but communication hasn't been very successful. Is anyone else still in the same boat?<br><br>\nWedding is a little over a month away, so I am starting to panic <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nThanks:)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadyav@hotmail.ca","IpAddress":"198.161.230.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392837580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NadyaV","Id":276785,"Name":"NadyaV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55a73265e2e938ccfb02fd2aeb7e2bba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I met with the new GM of Dreams Los Cabos last night and expressed some concerns with the new wedding department. &amp;nbsp;I was told that they should not be responding much faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847961,"PostDate":1399042849,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I met with the new GM of Dreams Los Cabos last night and expressed some concerns with the new wedding department. \u00a0I was told that they should not be responding much faster.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.129.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26f3912efeb31844b273319397b17742","RawContent":"[quote name=\"NadyaV\" post=\"1841321\" timestamp=\"1396209634\"]\nHi everyone! \n\nThis is my first time posting on here, but I see I am in the same boat as others! My wedding is May 6, 2014 and my new WC is Shantal Carrizales!  I still have some bigger details to plan, but communication hasn&#039;t been very successful. Is anyone else still in the same boat?\n\nWedding is a little over a month away, so I am starting to panic :(\n\nThanks:)[\/quote]I would love to hear how your wedding turns out! We are getting married there in October &amp;amp; have recently had some serious reservations.  Since all of the changes have occurred, the response time from our new WC (Marcella) have actually increased substantially &amp;amp; she has been a huge help; however, I can&#039;t say the same about the Dreams staff in general &amp;amp; particularly management &amp;amp; the reservation staff. I hope your big day goes perfectly!  \n\nThanks, \nBrandy","Attachments":[],"Id":1849341,"PostDate":1399677657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>NadyaV, on 30 March 2014 - 12:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nHi everyone! <br><br>\nThis is my first time posting on here, but I see I am in the same boat as others! My wedding is May 6, 2014 and my new WC is Shantal Carrizales!  I still have some bigger details to plan, but communication hasn't been very successful. Is anyone else still in the same boat?<br><br>\nWedding is a little over a month away, so I am starting to panic <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nThanks:)<\/p><\/div><\/div><br \/>I would love to hear how your wedding turns out! We are getting married there in October & have recently had some serious reservations.  Since all of the changes have occurred, the response time from our new WC (Marcella) have actually increased substantially & she has been a huge help; however, I can't say the same about the Dreams staff in general & particularly management & the reservation staff. I hope your big day goes perfectly!  <br><br>\nThanks, <br>\nBrandy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elli0747@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.199.129.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1378319072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273210.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BandR101914","Id":273210,"Name":"BandR101914","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
