Thailand. since 250 sheets of card stock would have been a waste, the girl at Staple&#039;s Copy &amp;amp; Print suggested that I purchase them by the sheet. She only charged me the price of a black and white print, one sided. I only spent $7.00!! Next is the sleeves and envelopes.... not sure what colors I want them yet. I ordered little elephant charms off of ETSY too! Please let me know if any of you have any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883378,"PostDate":1421712176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here is my finished project template! we are only inviting about 30 guests to join us to Thailand. since 250 sheets of card stock would have been a waste, the girl at Staple's Copy & Print suggested that I purchase them by the sheet. She only charged me the price of a black and white print, one sided. I only spent $7.00!! Next is the sleeves and envelopes.... not sure what colors I want them yet. I ordered little elephant charms off of ETSY too! Please let me know if any of you have any suggestions?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nina3885@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.67.56.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420162321,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281543.jpg?_r=1433243443","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"niina8","Id":281543,"Name":"niina8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78638,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46a1d3a1e211bf6d3b3d0dacabd1c822","RawContent":"[quote name=\"niina8\" post=\"1883378\" timestamp=\"1421712176\"]\nHere is my finished project template! we are only inviting about 30 guests to join us to Thailand. since 250 sheets of card stock would have been a waste, the girl at Staple&#039;s Copy &amp;amp; Print suggested that I purchase them by the sheet. She only charged me the price of a black and white print, one sided. I only spent $7.00!! Next is the sleeves and envelopes.... not sure what colors I want them yet. I ordered little elephant charms off of ETSY too! Please let me know if any of you have any suggestions?[\/quote]\nOk ladies. A question please. How do you get publisher without paying an arm and a leg for it? I looked at it and they $109.99  Sorry - I don&#039;t use it that much but is there another way?? I can&#039;t see this file unfortunately.","Attachments":[],"Id":1883392,"PostDate":1421721612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>niina8, on 19 January 2015 - 04:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Here is my finished project template! we are only inviting about 30 guests to join us to Thailand. since 250 sheets of card stock would have been a waste, the girl at Staple's Copy & Print suggested that I purchase them by the sheet. She only charged me the price of a black and white print, one sided. I only spent $7.00!! Next is the sleeves and envelopes.... not sure what colors I want them yet. I ordered little elephant charms off of ETSY too! Please let me know if any of you have any suggestions?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok ladies. A question please. How do you get publisher without paying an arm and a leg for it? I looked at it and they $109.99\u00a0 Sorry - I don't use it that much but is there another way?? I can't see this file unfortunately.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.67.56.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78638,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d7977b1104e854980858d85645b7b6a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1883392\" timestamp=\"1421721612\"]\nOk ladies. A question please. How do you get publisher without paying an arm and a leg for it? I looked at it and they $109.99  Sorry - I don&#039;t use it that much but is there another way?? I can&#039;t see this file unfortunately.[\/quote]\nI got mine through work... I used publisher because it&#039;s easier than word or power point. There  are other templates on this forum for word or power point.... You&#039;ll just have to search through.","Attachments":[],"Id":1883551,"PostDate":1421802717,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 19 January 2015 - 06:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Ok ladies. A question please. How do you get publisher without paying an arm and a leg for it? I looked at it and they $109.99\u00a0 Sorry - I don't use it that much but is there another way?? I can't see this file unfortunately.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI got mine through work... I used publisher because it's easier than word or power point. There  are other templates on this forum for word or power point.... You'll just have to search through.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nina3885@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.67.56.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420162321,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281543.jpg?_r=1433243443","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"niina8","Id":281543,"Name":"niina8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"T